  "hypothesis": "Blank background evidence is needed when an estimated font width drives an inpaint selection. In this source the initial width clipped the left side of multiple original captions. Native-frame comparisons across a dark corridor and a bright floor confirmed the benefit of widening the glyph selection. Grayscale eye and floor texture still soften locally. The same result should not be assumed for other videos.",
